---
import IconGitHub from "~icons/simple-icons/github";
import IconBook from "~icons/codicon/book";
import IconLinkExternal from "~icons/codicon/link-external";
---

<div class="space-y-10 text-sm">
  <!-- Bio -->
  <section class="leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">
    <p>
      I'm a senior software engineer currently at <a
        href="https://astratech.ae/"
        target="_blank"
        class="text-primary dark:text-primary-muted font-medium no-underline hover:underline"
        >Astra Tech</a
      > in Abu Dhabi, building high-performance backend systems in Rust. Over the
      past seven years I've worked across the stack, from frontend at AQR Capital
      and ByteDance to full-stack development and internal tooling at Apple.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3">
      My interests are in distributed systems, programming languages, and
      compilers. I also write about mathematics at <a
        href="https://twopi.dev"
        target="_blank"
        class="text-primary dark:text-primary-muted font-medium no-underline hover:underline"
        >TwoPi ↗</a
      >.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Experience -->
  <section>
    <h2
      class="text-primary dark:text-primary-muted mb-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase"
    >
      Experience
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-5">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
          <a
            href="https://astratech.ae/"
            target="_blank"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted font-semibold text-slate-900 no-underline dark:text-white"
            >Astra Tech</a
          >
          <span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            >Aug 2025 – Present</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Senior Rust Engineer · Abu Dhabi, UAE
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          High-performance Rust microservices with Tokio; cross-platform FFI
          logic layer for iOS and Android.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
          <a
            href="https://www.bytedance.com/"
            target="_blank"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted font-semibold text-slate-900 no-underline dark:text-white"
            >ByteDance</a
          >
          <span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            >Dec 2024 – Jun 2025</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Software Engineer · Dubai, UAE
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          Micro-frontend architecture (Garfish); frontend development with
          React, Vue.js, and SolidJS.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
          <a
            href="https://www.apple.com/"
            target="_blank"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted font-semibold text-slate-900 no-underline dark:text-white"
            >Apple</a
          >
          <span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            >Jul 2021 – Dec 2024</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Software Engineer · Hyderabad, India
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          Full-stack development on large-scale enterprise web applications;
          designed a rule-engine DSL with parser and auto-complete; managed
          platform infrastructure on AWS with Kubernetes and Tekton.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
          <a
            href="https://www.aqr.com/"
            target="_blank"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted font-semibold text-slate-900 no-underline dark:text-white"
            >AQR Capital Management</a
          >
          <span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            >Jun 2019 – Jul 2021</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Analyst · Bengaluru, India
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          Frontend apps for Portfolio Management and Trading; built a shared
          component library.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
          <a
            href="https://ijep.t.u-tokyo.ac.jp/"
            target="_blank"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted font-semibold text-slate-900 no-underline dark:text-white"
            >The University of Tokyo</a
          >
          <span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            >May – Jul 2018</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Research Intern · Tokyo, Japan
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          HPC applied to tensor computations; optimized the HOTRG algorithm
          under Prof. Reiji Suda.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Education -->
  <section>
    <h2
      class="text-primary dark:text-primary-muted mb-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase"
    >
      Education
    </h2>
    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
      <a
        href="https://www.iith.ac.in/"
        target="_blank"
        class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted font-semibold text-slate-900 no-underline dark:text-white"
        >Indian Institute of Technology Hyderabad</a
      >
      <span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
        >2015 – 2019</span
      >
    </div>
    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
      B.Tech. (Honors) in <a
        href="https://cse.iith.ac.in"
        target="_blank"
        class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted text-slate-600 no-underline dark:text-slate-400"
        >Computer Science and Engineering</a
      > · CGPA 9.4/10
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Projects -->
  <section>
    <h2
      class="text-primary dark:text-primary-muted mb-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase"
    >
      Projects
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Berth</span>
          <a
            href="https://berth.prateek.page"
            target="_blank"
            aria-label="Website"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            ><IconLinkExternal class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /></a
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Self-hostable deployment platform for running your own apps and sites.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white"
            >Luma Money</span
          >
          <a
            href="https://lumamoney.com"
            target="_blank"
            aria-label="Website"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            ><IconLinkExternal class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /></a
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Personal finance management app to track expenses and spending
          insights.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white"
            >Open-WBO-Inc</span
          >
          <a
            href="https://github.com/sbjoshi/Open-WBO-Inc"
            target="_blank"
            aria-label="GitHub"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            ><IconGitHub class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /></a
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Partial incomplete MaxSAT solver in C++. 1st place (60s track) and 2nd
          place (300s track) at MaxSAT Evaluations 2018.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white"
            >UTVPI-OA</span
          >
          <a
            href="https://github.com/IITH-Compilers/UTVPI-OA"
            target="_blank"
            aria-label="GitHub"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            ><IconGitHub class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /></a
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Algorithms for overapproximations of polyhedra using Linear
          Programming and Fourier-Motzkin elimination.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white"
            >Battleship</span
          >
          <a
            href="https://github.com/prateekkumarweb/battleship"
            target="_blank"
            aria-label="GitHub"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            ><IconGitHub class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /></a
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Multi-player Battleship board game in Rust using WebSockets.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white"
            >SAT Solver in Rust</span
          >
          <a
            href="https://github.com/solhop/rsat"
            target="_blank"
            aria-label="GitHub"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            ><IconGitHub class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /></a
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          SAT solver based on the MiniSAT architecture, written in Rust.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white"
            >Autojudge</span
          >
          <a
            href="https://github.com/vbsinha/autojudge"
            target="_blank"
            aria-label="GitHub"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            ><IconGitHub class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /></a
          >
          <a
            href="https://autojudge.readthedocs.io/"
            target="_blank"
            aria-label="Docs"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            ><IconBook class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /></a
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Online judge for programming contests and university assignments.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white"
            >Timetabler</span
          >
          <a
            href="https://github.com/sukrutrao/Timetabler"
            target="_blank"
            aria-label="GitHub"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            ><IconGitHub class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /></a
          >
          <a
            href="https://timetabler.readthedocs.io/"
            target="_blank"
            aria-label="Docs"
            class="hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary-muted text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
            ><IconBook class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /></a
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Timetable scheduling via MaxSAT solver, used by IIT Hyderabad for
          semester scheduling.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Skills -->
  <section>
    <h2
      class="text-primary dark:text-primary-muted mb-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase"
    >
      Skills
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
      Rust · JavaScript/TypeScript · Golang · C/C++ · Git · Docker · SQL
    </p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
      Distributed Systems · Programming Languages · Compilers
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Publications -->
  <section>
    <h2
      class="text-primary dark:text-primary-muted mb-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase"
    >
      Publications
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-3">
      <a
        href="https://scholar.google.co.in/citations?user=M1NFyhAAAAAJ&hl=en"
        target="_blank"
        class="text-primary dark:text-primary-muted no-underline hover:underline"
        >Google Scholar ↗</a
      >
    </p>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div>
        <p class="font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">
          Open-WBO-Inc: Approximation Strategies for Incomplete Weighted MaxSAT
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Saurabh Joshi, <em>Prateek Kumar</em>, Sukrut Rao, Ruben Martins ·
          JSAT 2019
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://content.iospress.com/download/journal-on-satisfiability-boolean-modeling-and-computation/sat190118?id=journal-on-satisfiability-boolean-modeling-and-computation%2Fsat190118"
          target="_blank"
          class="text-primary dark:text-primary-muted text-xs no-underline hover:underline"
          >PDF ↗</a
        >
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">
          An analysis of executable size reduction by LLVM passes
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Shalini Jain, Utpal Bora, <em>Prateek Kumar</em>, Vaibhav B. Sinha,
          Suresh Purini, Ramakrishna Upadrasta · CSIT 2019
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007%2Fs40012-019-00248-5"
          target="_blank"
          class="text-primary dark:text-primary-muted text-xs no-underline hover:underline"
          >PDF ↗</a
        >
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">
          Approximation Strategies for Incomplete MaxSAT
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Saurabh Joshi, <em>Prateek Kumar</em>, Ruben Martins, Sukrut Rao · CP
          2018
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/978-3-319-98334-9_15.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          class="text-primary dark:text-primary-muted text-xs no-underline hover:underline"
          >PDF ↗</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
